o discussion, compare.\n\nWe should mention that A's strengths are strong technical and anticipation, but concerns about cooperation and communication (show-off, not open to new ideas, not good at taking criticism). This may outweigh strengths for long-distance pilot where crew cooperation is critical.\n\nThus we can argue that B remains best despite communication tone issues, because B's issues are more manageable.\n\nWe need to state our vote: Candidate B.\n\nProvide evidence: A's crew cooperation concerns, B's strengths.\n\nMake a concise argument.\n\nProceed."}
