ew cooperation. We need to decide if B still best. Likely B remains best. We can argue that D's adaptability is only \"adequate\" vs B's strong stress handling, and D's arrogance and loner profile raise crew cooperation concerns, making B still preferable. Also D's lack of feedback orientation is unknown, but arrogance suggests possible issue. So we keep vote for B.\n\nWe need to reference prior discussion: mention Sarah's note on D's adaptability and lack of feedback orientation, and James's note on C's stress handling but crew cooperation issues. Also Emily's earlier recommendation. Then state we still recommend B, because D's adaptability is only adequate, and crew cooperation concerns (loner, moody, arrogant) outweigh B's communication tone which is more remediable.\n\nThus produce PUBLIC_MESSAGE and METADATA_JSON with vote Candidate B."}
